{
    "title": "Word Search - Word Puzzle Game",
    "description": "Welcome to Word Search Quest, the most addicting word puzzle game tailored for everyone on mobile and tablet! Hunt words now! \ud83d\udd0e\r\n\r\nPlay the Quest and go through thousands of levels with increasing difficulty. Unlock rewards and discover new words.\r\n\r\nChoose and play non stop themes you love such as Animals, Countries, Actors or Delicious Foods! Choose you difficulty and have fun\r\n\r\nIn the RELAX mode, you find hidden words at your own pace and with your own difficulty setting \r\n\r\n\u2b50 Easy to play with a fresh and modern look\r\n\u2b50 Have fun in the Quest road and play smarter and smarter puzzles\r\n\u2b50 Play without connection, whenever and wherever you want\r\n\u2b50 No timer, no pressure\r\n\u2b50 Special rewards: the more words you found, the more coins\r\n\u2b50 Unlock 23 themes, with more to come\r\n\u2b50 Relax mode with an infinite numbers of grids with difficulties for everyone\r\n\u2b50 10 Languages with more than 3000 words per language \r\n\r\nWord Search Quest is completely FREE to play, enjoy now an unlimited number of word puzzles and hours of brain teasers!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Word Search Quest, the most addicting word puzzle game tailored for everyone on mobile and tablet! Hunt words now! \ud83d\udd0e<br><br>Play the Quest and go through thousands of levels with increasing difficulty. Unlock rewards and discover new words.<br><br>Choose and play non stop themes you love such as Animals, Countries, Actors or Delicious Foods! Choose you difficulty and have fun<br><br>In the RELAX mode, you find hidden words at your own pace and with your own difficulty setting <br><br>\u2b50 Easy to play with a fresh and modern look<br>\u2b50 Have fun in the Quest road and play smarter and smarter puzzles<br>\u2b50 Play without connection, whenever and wherever you want<br>\u2b50 No timer, no pressure<br>\u2b50 Special rewards: the more words you found, the more coins<br>\u2b50 Unlock 23 themes, with more to come<br>\u2b50 Relax mode with an infinite numbers of grids with difficulties for everyone<br>\u2b50 10 Languages with more than 3000 words per language <br><br>Word Search Quest is completely FREE to play, enjoy now an unlimited number of word puzzles and hours of brain teasers!",
